Polyglot Workshop – Developing LLMs for Low-Resource Languages

This repo stores the materials for the "Polyglot Workshop – Developing LLMs for Low-Resource Languages". The Workshop is a four-day (five if you count the setting up), hands-on program focused on sharing expertise in building large language models, with a special emphasis on underrepresented languages. Our goal is to empower a new generation of practitioners to advance LLM development beyond high-resource settings. The Workshop covers all key stages of an LLM training pipeline, making this knowledge accessible to a broad and diverse audience.
